{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And there did not arise a prophet again in Israel like Moshe —</b> even in Israel, but among the nations it need not be said, as it is written: ״ונפלינו אני ועמך מכל העם אשר על פני האדמה״." "<b>Whom HaShem knew face to face —</b> as it is written: ״פה אל פה אדבר בו ומראה ולא בחידות ותמונת ה׳ יביט״. Another interpretation: the Holy One, blessed be He, knew Moshe, but Moshe did not know the Holy One, blessed be He, face to face, as it is written: ״לא יראני האדם וחי״."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:55:36.005061042Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}